  "notes": "The Turtle knowledge base's Arms list: Mortal Strike on cooldown, Slam as the standing-still filler, Overpower after the mob dodges in Battle Stance, Execute below 20%, the opener's Sunder and Bloodrage, Heroic Strike once rage would cap, and the AoE rows (Sweeping Strikes, Mortal Strike, Cleave). Whirlwind needs Berserker Stance, which this file leaves to the preset's stance strategy; the swing timer it asks Slam to wait for is not a condition. Stance and taunt stay with the preset.",
